Package: biasawareLID
Type: Package
Title: Bias-Aware Detection of Group-Specific Local Item Dependence
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Fatih", "Ozkan", email = "fozkan@central.uh.edu",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements the centered bias-aware network psychometric pipeline
    for detecting local item dependence with group-specific bias awareness:
    confirmatory factor residualization, signed centering of Yen residual
    correlations, weighted topological overlap, within-group permutation
    inference with Benjamini-Hochberg false discovery control, a qualified
    reference set, a retention-constrained group-disparity penalty, signed
    reversal diagnostics, designed-truth simulation, and stratified
    full-pipeline bootstrap stability. Methods described in Ozkan (2026).
